{"text": "She was one of those pretty and charming girls who are sometimes born, as if by a mistake of fate, into a family of clerks. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> She had no dowry, no hopes, and no way of being known and loved by a rich and important man. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> So she let herself be married to a minor clerk in the Ministry of Education. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> She suffered endlessly, feeling that she had been born for every luxury and delicacy. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> She suffered from the poorness of her home, from its worn walls, its ugly chairs, and its faded curtains. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> When she sat down to dinner and her husband cried happily, Ah, good soup, she dreamed of silver dishes and elegant dinners. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> She had no fine dresses, no jewels, nothing, and yet she loved nothing else. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> She had a rich friend, a former schoolmate, whom she no longer wanted to visit. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> She suffered so much when she came home from her visits that she cried for days.", "alignment": {"characters": ["S", "h", "e", " ", "w", "a", "s", " ", "o", "n", "e", " ", "o", "f", " ", "t", "h", "o", "s", "e", " ", "p", "r", "e", "t", "t", "y", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "c", "h", "a", "r", "m", "i", "n", "g", " ", "g", "i", "r", "l", "s", " ", "w", "h", "o", " ", "a", "r", "e", " ", "s", "o", "m", "e", "t", "i", "m", "e", "s", " ", "b", "o", "r", "n", ",", " ", "a", "s", " ", "i", "f", " ", "b", "y", " ", "a", " ", "m", "i", "s", "t", "a", "k", "e", " ", "o", "f", " ", "f", "a", "t", "e", ",", " ", "i", "n", "t", "o", " ", "a", " ", "f", "a", "m", "i", "l", "y", " ", "o", "f", " ", "c", "l", "e", "r", "k", "s", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "S", "h", "e", " ", "h", "a", "d", " ", "n", "o", " ", "d", "o", "w", "r", "y", ",", " ", "n", "o", " ", "h", "o", "p", "e", "s", ",", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "n", "o", " ", "w", "a", "y